		<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBXF043D59E43ED4564BE1AE721C23DAF6B">
			<Properties>
				<string name="Name">READ_ME_FIRST</string>
				<string name="Value">Change colors, texts, sizes and positions in the Properties window. Keep these names: Window, CodeBox, Redeem, Message (and OpenCodes, Close, Title, Hint). The text of a button (OpenCodes, Redeem, Close) is the TextLabel Label inside it: its gradient is a UIGradient on the button. Message colors its background by the result only when it has a visible background. Do not delete this window when you update DiscordCodes. The Window is hidden so it does not cover the screen in Studio: to edit it, select Window and tick Visible, then untick it again when you finish. In the game it opens with the OpenCodes button.</string>
			</Properties>
		</Item>
